    "why": [
      "Saves 55% irrigation water (1050 mm/yr \u2014 ~14 flood irrigations and 578 hrs/ha of 5-HP borewell pumping) vs. baseline [FAO-56]. Directly counters regional GRACE-FO terrestrial water storage decline of 0.6 cm/yr.",
      "Elevates Soil Health Score to 74/100 (+17 pts vs. baseline) and changes 10-year topsoil organic carbon by +2.1 t C/ha, saving 4.6 bags/ha of 45-kg Urea via biological N fixation [RothC-lite \u00b7 SoilGrids].",
      "Provides a 34-day Kharif-to-Rabi turnaround window for Happy Seeder / zero-till sowing with in-situ residue mulching \u2014 eliminating Oct\u2013Nov stubble burning monitored by NASA FIRMS.",
      "Timely sowing schedule buffers crops against 94 annual extreme heat days (>35\u00b0C) and 43.0 March\u2013April terminal grain-filling heat days (>32\u00b0C) recorded by NASA POWER.",
      "Delivers median net operating return of \u20b9203,421/ha (\u20b982,322/acre) with a worst-10% drought downside buffer (CVaR-10) of \u20b9183,834/ha (\u20b974,395/acre) [CACP MSP 2024-25]. Eligible schemes: Crop Diversification / Mera Pani Meri Virasat (\u20b917,500/ha state incentive); Direct-Seeded Rice (DSR) Promotion Scheme (\u20b93,750/ha support)."
